    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33144" root="فحل" body-key="f">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افحلهُ</span></b> , (S,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افحلهُ فَحْلًا</span>, (K, TA,) <i>He
gave to him,</i> (S,) or <i>lent to him,</i> (K, TA,) <i>a male</i>
[<i>camel</i>] (S, K, TA) <i>to cover among his</i> [<i>she-</i>]
<i>camels:</i> (S, TA:) and accord. to Lh, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانَا</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَحَلَ</span></b> 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَعِيرًا</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افتحلهُ</span></b>  signify <i>he gave to such a one a
he-camel;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افحلهُ</span>. (TA.)

